{c: Verse 1}
[C7] O saathii [Eb] re,        [F] tere binaa bhii [G] kyaa [C7] jiinaa
[F] Tere binaa bhii [G] kyaa [F] jiinaa,        [Am] Phoolon Mein Kaliyon Mein
[Am] Sapno Ki Galiyon Mein,        [Eb] Tere Bina Kuh [C7] Kahin Na
[F] Tere binaa bhii [G] kyaa [C7] jiinaa,        [C7] O saathii [Eb] re
[G] Tujh bin [Em] jogan,        [G] merii [Em] raatein,
[Am] tujh bin mere,        [G] din banjaare
[G] Meraa [Em] jiivan,        [G] jaltii [Em] bhumi,
[Am] bujhe-bujhe mere,        [G] sapane saare
[G] Tere binaa [C] aa [G] aa,        [G] Tere binaa merii,
mere binaa terii,        [Eb] ye zindagii [C7] zindagii na
[F] Tere binaa bhii [G] kyaa [C7] jiinaa,        [C7] O saathii [Eb] re
Har dhadakan mein,        pyaas hai terii, saanson mein
hai terii khushbuu,        Is dharatii se us ambar tak,
merii nazar mein tuu hii tuu hai,        Pyaar ye tuute na aa aa
Pyaar ye tuute na, tuu mujhase,        ruuthe na, saath ye chhuute kabhii na
